{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14109080","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14109080","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1410908001:1":{"text":"那声音！是龙……龙飞走了！","source_cn":"那声音！是龙……龙飞走了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01D4D7B9EDCF69B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410908002:1":{"text":"声音从广场那边传来！我得去看看……","source_cn":"声音从广场那边传来！我得去看看……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FB2782EFB5C32C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410908003:1":{"text":"女王一旦崩逝，她用魔力维系的女王雕像也会随之破碎，萨洛克兰将陷入恐慌。","source_cn":"女王一旦崩逝，她用魔力维系的女王雕像也会随之破碎，萨洛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6D43F98E1339C02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410908004:1":{"text":"因度厄！你的意思我懂，但你刚刚杀了……这时候过去也太危险了！","source_cn":"因度厄！你的意思我懂，但你刚刚杀了……这时候过去也太危险了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA13876BCEE1C82D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410908005:1":{"text":"正因如此，我更要去。","source_cn":"正因如此，我更要去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE89FBB20B63FF686","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410908006:1":{"text":"卫队需要维持秩序，安抚民众。哪怕……","source_cn":"卫队需要维持秩序，安抚民众。哪怕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F65CC6C98CAAB62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410908007:1":{"text":"你这个死脑筋！现在过去要是被抓了可怎么办！","source_cn":"你这个死脑筋！现在过去要是被抓了可怎么办！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FABB1C46D712648","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410908008:1":{"text":"我是因度厄，萨洛克兰的卫队长。在我的职务尚未被解除之前——","source_cn":"我是因度厄，萨洛克兰的卫队长。在我的职务尚未被解除之前——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41F0D738797E48CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410908009:1":{"text":"我绝不会在民众最需要的时候躲藏！","source_cn":"我绝不会在民众最需要的时候躲藏！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6DC7983119280B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1410908009":{"text":"我绝不会在民众最需要的时候躲藏！","source_cn":"我绝不会在民众最需要的时候躲藏！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6DC7983119280B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410908010:1":{"text":"哇……你都这么说了，我们还能怎么办？好吧，加我一个！","source_cn":"哇……你都这么说了，我们还能怎么办？好吧，加我一个！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2